The pure-FMA number (2.0/cyc at ~3.13GHz) is solid, but several probes were CSE'd by GCC (loads were loop-invariant). Let me redo with inline asm so the compiler can't cheat:

<antml:function_calls>
<antml:invoke name="bash">
