[2026-08-23T21:17:07.697720+00:00] [system] Processing action from model: 


The machine picture is clear now. Key findings vs prior notes:
- zmm FMA sustains **2.0/tsc-tick** (~1.6/core-cycle @3.25GHz) — the real currency
- Loads are **free** alongside FMAs up to 1:2 ratio (3.1 vuops/tsc!); stores ~free at 1:4
- Shuffles cost ~an FMA slot each; broadcasts halve FMA rate; **divider ops (vdivpd/vsqrtpd) cost ~45 tsc each mixed with FMA — totally unusable**
- vrsqrt14pd/vrcp14pd fast here (1.65 tsc) in small context (must re-verify in big code)
- L1 copy 83B/tsc; L2 read 57/write 24; L3 ~12/10; DRAM 7/4

Now let me design and build. First the development harness:

