Now I'll build my own generator-based implementation. Design decisions from the measurements:

**Units**: vop = 512-bit vector op @ 2/tsc; loads free ≤1:2, stores ≤1:4; no divider ops; map = 18 vops/8 sites via rsqrt14+2 Newton & rcp14+2 Newton.

**Architecture**: 
- L∈{36,45,64}: within-volume split re/im, *one-sweep-per-step* pipeline alternating slab/plane visits, each doing [complete axis_t, +c, map, pre-transform 2 axes of t+1] with 8×8-transpose-based Z-pass; chain-L2-resident per volume
- L∈{6,8,13,17,23}: SoA-8 batch lanes, folded prime matvecs with register-resident constants

